# @name createFirstAcceptConflictCase

POST {{baseUrl}}/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{actorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUuid": "{{acceptConflictTargetUuid}}",
  "title": "Acceptance conflict case one"
}

